BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 700.77 Tm (Title: Serve, Default, Record, Insure) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 685.55 Tm (Action: Serve all defendants, enter defaults, obtain the judgment, let the appeal period run, and record it.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 670.32 Tm (Detail: The perfected judgment is recorded at the Register of Deeds like any deed or mortgage [Quiet Title) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 655.10 Tm (Michigan - kJRxvYeK_eU @ 00:08:02], then taken to the same title company, which will issue title insurance) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 639.87 Tm (against it [Tax Sale Academy - 7BP12s9Jn2c @ 00:06:33].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 617.65 Tm (Executing the lien foreclosure starts with one question: who drives it. Tax Sale Secrets splits states into) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 602.42 Tm (self-executing systems, where the lienholder fills out a form or gives the county the go-ahead and the county) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 587.20 Tm (sends every notice, and non-self-executing systems, where the burden sits on the lienholder and the move) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 571.97 Tm (is to hire a real estate attorney and bake that cost into the deal [rQco9s4XodM @ 00:16:31]. They flag) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 556.75 Tm (Florida as self-executing with a twist: the county runs the parcel through a tax deed sale, pays lienholders) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 541.52 Tm (from the proceeds, and only hands over the property if nobody bids [rQco9s4XodM @ 00:18:02]. Saen) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 526.30 Tm (Higgins describes the notice blast going to everyone with a financial interest, a response window of roughly) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 511.07 Tm (60 days in some counties and 100 in others, and attorney fees of about $500 on simple files up to $3,000 to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 495.85 Tm ($4,000 on complicated ones, which the owner must also pay if they redeem mid-process [EXkUbWWenl0 @) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 480.62 Tm (00:07:50]. Dustin Hahn budgets one to two thousand dollars for the foreclosure attorney, roughly another) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 465.40 Tm (thousand for the follow-on quiet title, plus a year or two of subsequent taxes [tXVBp8vbkT4 @ 00:05:34].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 450.17 Tm (The quiet title suit itself follows a fixed sequence that Darren Findlay of Quiet Title Michigan lays out step by) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 434.95 Tm (step: run an independent title search even if a title company already did one, stack the deeds into a chain,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 419.72 Tm (then cast a wide net of defendants because missing one fish means the judgment fails to clear title and the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 404.50 Tm (process starts over [kJRxvYeK_eU @ 00:03:19]. The complaint is filed in the circuit court where the property) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 389.27 Tm (sits, fees are paid, and service of process begins, using personal service where possible, certified mail, or a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 374.05 Tm (court order for alternate means such as publishing in the legal news and mailing last known addresses for) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 358.82 Tm (missing owners, defunct entities and probate estates [kJRxvYeK_eU @ 00:04:56]. Findlay calls service the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 343.60 Tm (most time-consuming step, then files the default, re-serves it, obtains the default judgment, waits out the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 328.37 Tm (appeal period and records the perfected judgment at the Register of Deeds [kJRxvYeK_eU @ 00:08:02].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 313.15 Tm (Casey Dimmon times the same track: a good attorney files within a week or two, defendants get 30 or 45) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 297.92 Tm (days to respond, and backed-up courts can add eight months to a year before a judge even sees the file) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 282.70 Tm ([7BP12s9Jn2c @ 00:13:14].) Tj ET
