BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 641.10 Tm (Experian, Equifax and TransUnion voluntarily stopped reporting liens after a CFPB study found entries) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 625.87 Tm (linked to the wrong people, and stresses that voluntarily means the bureaus could reverse course) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 610.65 Tm ([_kLMdX9sR6Y @ 00:06:50]. IRS Notices Explained quotes Experian outright, tax liens are no longer a part) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 595.42 Tm (of credit reports, and tells viewers the score itself is safe from this public record [B1e8xDSixVg @ 00:00:45].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 580.20 Tm (Chad Silver of IRS FBAR Tax Attorney runs the opposite script, warning that a lien often drops a score 100) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 564.97 Tm (points and surfaces on background checks for employment and professional licenses [D-ia73OSPG0 @) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 549.75 Tm (00:00:52]. Anton at Stop IRS Problems lands in the middle: the government no longer files liens with the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 534.52 Tm (bureaus, yet the bureaus still pick them up from county recorders through digital exchange, and some liens) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 519.30 Tm (even get published in newspapers where a local school district might see them [MLaWCy3MlMQ @) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 504.07 Tm (00:02:08]. Every camp agrees on one point that matters at the closing table: the notice is a recorded public) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 488.85 Tm (document, so any lender or title examiner who searches county records will find it no matter what a bureau) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 473.62 Tm (prints.) Tj ET
