BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 443.17 Tm (Jablonsky treats it as a hard checklist: $25,000 or less assessed including penalties and interest, a direct) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 427.95 Tm (debit installment agreement that pays out within 60 months or before the ten-year statute, full filing) Tj ET
