BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 669.77 Tm (For auction buyers, the costliest mistake is treating the gavel as the finish line. Global Estate Hub LLC says) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 654.55 Tm (that if you launch the cosmetic flip, granite countertops, hardwood floors, new cabinets, before the 120-day) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 639.32 Tm (window closes and the IRS redeems, every cent of those upgrades is gone [q4Kqh7Vleyg @ 00:05:23]. The) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 624.10 Tm (same channel flags a second wall: on day 30 a title company will mandate an exception for the redemption) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 608.87 Tm (right, and no standard buyer's mortgage lender will fund over it, so a quick resale is dead until the clock runs) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 593.65 Tm (or a waiver lands [q4Kqh7Vleyg @ 00:06:21]. Check the notice trail before bidding too, because if the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 578.42 Tm (foreclosing bank never delivered written notice to the IRS at least 25 days before a non-judicial sale, the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 563.20 Tm (federal lien survives intact [q4Kqh7Vleyg @ 00:03:01]. Natalia Willette adds that the lien only gets) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 547.97 Tm (extinguished if the foreclosure actually goes to sale; a settlement or deed in lieu leaves it standing, and once) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 532.75 Tm (the redemption letter arrives an investor who misses the 15-day window to submit expense proof and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 517.52 Tm (senior-lien releases is gambling with reimbursement [GoBskUnMJ5k @ 00:01:19]. The economics check is) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 502.30 Tm (blunt: capital parks for four months earning the statutory 6% if the IRS redeems.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 487.07 Tm (On the taxpayer side, the failure pattern practitioners keep repeating is silence. Chad Silver's client Richard) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 471.85 Tm (ignored the lien notice for lack of money; six months later the IRS levied $59,000 from the bank account and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 456.62 Tm (started garnishing 30% of wages [D-ia73OSPG0 @ 00:01:07]. Read The Corner shows how one day kills) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 441.40 Tm (leverage: a Form 12153 postmarked on Day 31 misses the window, and the fallback equivalent hearing,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 426.17 Tm (requested within one year, carries no Tax Court review and no required pause in collection [FEsG-qPFvMc) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 410.95 Tm (@ 00:09:40]. Dan Britt, after 35 years of practice, says one or two taxpayers every year get the bad news) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 395.72 Tm (that they lost their best opportunity to settle or resolve the debt [eZJCPENFp3o @ 00:03:26]. Logan Allec) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 380.50 Tm (warns that chasing hardship status as an exit backfires: currently not collectible status will not withdraw an) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 365.27 Tm (existing notice, and if no notice exists yet there is an almost guaranteed chance the IRS files one, because) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 350.05 Tm (nothing else would stop someone owing $100,000 from selling a house with $200,000 of equity and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 334.82 Tm (pocketing roughly $150,000 after costs [Fl9ZtNoyzj8 @ 00:04:14]. Chad Silver also notes fewer than one in) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 319.60 Tm (three offers in compromise get accepted, so a sloppy offer just burns time while the lien sits.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 304.37 Tm (The real estate closing table is where sequencing errors quietly cost operators their deals. Clarity Tax Relief) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 289.15 Tm (says the trap that blindsides homeowners is a clean FICO score paired with a refinance that dies at the title) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 273.92 Tm (search, and that a subordination request filed late or framed badly can blow the closing outright) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 258.70 Tm ([oPKD4zP1XUQ @ 00:06:29]. IRS Notices Explained puts the hard number on it: the certificate application) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 243.47 Tm (goes in at least 45 days before the transaction, with a current title report that is mandatory for subordination,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 228.25 Tm (a proposed closing statement, and exact property descriptions down to a 15-character aircraft serial number) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 213.02 Tm ([B1e8xDSixVg @ 00:05:53]. Logan Allec adds that the payoff demand usually exceeds the amount printed) Tj ET
