BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 605.77 Tm (The most expensive reversals come from skipping the property check, and several operators admit taking) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 590.55 Tm (the hit themselves. Joanne Musa, who otherwise calls lien drive-bys a waste of gas, says they got burnt last) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 575.32 Tm (year precisely by skipping inspection, and warns online photos can be one to three years old) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 560.10 Tm ([DHgFebJCtQU @ 00:50:46]. On the Advanta IRA stage, Mo Hodges describes a buyer who paid $9,100) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 544.87 Tm (believing they had a Florida villa, received a strip of land instead, and is now in litigation, the textbook) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 529.65 Tm (buyer-beware loss [c3YDDPR5wVo @ 00:38:35]. Kessler's first deed was a gutted mobile home that only) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 514.42 Tm (broke even, which is why they now run two drive-bys, one by day and one by night, before any deed bid) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 499.20 Tm ([vD0IitWLjZE @ 00:38:30]. The Tax Sale Support team puts the stakes bluntly: more people have lost) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 483.97 Tm (money skipping on-site evaluation than by any other means, and they schedule visits a few days before the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 468.75 Tm (sale so redemptions clear first [sH-Esa2i1zE @ 00:26:28]. The economics check is simple. A $100 realtor) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 453.52 Tm (visit or $15 photo set is trivial against a $9,100 strip of land, so the inspection budget belongs inside the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 438.30 Tm (per-deal cost before the bid ceiling is ever set.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 423.07 Tm (The second trap is underpricing time and legal drag. Stephen Morel bought secondary-market liens after the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 407.85 Tm (redemption period had run, then hit an heir in occupancy with no probate opened and serial bankruptcy) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 392.62 Tm (filings; expected time to liquidity of 9 to 18 months stretched to about three years and ended in cash-for-keys) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 377.40 Tm (with first month's rent and moving costs paid [UyiZp8ocowM @ 00:29:16]. Morel also warns that one or two) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 362.17 Tm (missed noticing deadlines can derail an entire year's returns [UyiZp8ocowM @ 00:39:08]. Ted Thomas tells) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 346.95 Tm (buyers to plan on $2,000 to $5,000 extra for a clear title action, which normally takes months and in one) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 331.72 Tm (case took 18 [jDYlxXpw-e4 @ 00:41:33]. In Georgia, Mo Hodges puts foreclosure at about 90 days after the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 316.50 Tm (365-day period, with the investor paying for everything that happens after day 365 [c3YDDPR5wVo @) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 301.27 Tm (00:42:21]. For a scaling portfolio these are not edge cases; they are recurring carrying costs that compound) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 286.05 Tm (across every position held. A lien book funded with IRA dollars cannot pay a surprise attorney from outside) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 270.82 Tm (the plan, so the legal reserve, the noticing calendar and a realistic three-year worst-case hold all have to be) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 255.60 Tm (modeled before capital is committed.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 240.37 Tm (Custody fees and rate compression are the quiet killers of a small IRA lien book. Next Generation's best) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 225.15 Tm (structure is $325 per asset per year, on top of $100 per purchase and $5 per check or $30 per wire) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 209.92 Tm ([l9-Us7KWWPM @ 00:16:30]. On a $1,000 to $2,000 lien bid down to single digits, a per-asset fee can) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 194.70 Tm (consume most of the interest. NuView Trust prices differently, at $95 per purchase batch and $300 a year) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 179.47 Tm (for all held liens, which favors buying many liens in one process [Hqqt5H7mS3o @ 00:36:44]. The same) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 164.25 Tm (speaker reports winning Florida rates of 15% to 17% in 2008 now running below 6%. CamaPlan's math) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 149.02 Tm (shows fees can still pencil out: a $15,000 account pays $390 in first-year fees and $1,193 over five years) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 133.80 Tm (against $2,700 a year in interest, netting about 50% more than a taxable account [U08uLxrDVE4 @) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 118.57 Tm (00:49:01]. Platinum Investment Properties Group explains why rates keep falling: Florida went online, hedge) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 103.35 Tm (funds now bid a quarter of a percent to capture the 5% penalty, and sales went from 100 buyers to 50,000) Tj ET
